'''Xmas Pudding Cat''' (フィッシュドノエル Fisshu Do Noeru, '''Fish de Noël''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in [[Reindeer Fish Awakens!]] and [[Infernal Tower]]. It was added in [[Version 5.6 Update|Version 5.6]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Xmas Pudding Cat
|image = E 295.png
|appearance = [[Reindeer Fish Awakens!]]<br>
[[Infernal Tower/Floor 23|Infernal Tower - Floor 23]]
|money drop = 1,800¢ - 7,110¢
}}

==Enemy==
Xmas Pudding Cat has high health, area attack, and a fast attack rate. However, its attacks are close-ranged so it's best to use ranged attackers against this tasty terror.

==Strategy==
Use [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Mohawk Cat]], [[Crazed Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Cat]], [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Eraser Cat]] and [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Tank Cat]] for stalling. If the player has [[Pogo Cat (Rare Cat)|Jiangshi Cat]], he can be used as an alternative meatshield.

Use [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Leg Cat]], [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|King Dragon Cat]], and [[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Dragon Cat]] for support. Don't forget to bring [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Wolf]] and [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]] to lay down the hurt on him.

